# Accepted vulnerabilities in the shipped image, so the release scan does not
# fail on them. One entry per line: the CVE id, then optionally
# `exp:<YYYY-MM-DD>` and `statement:<reason>`. Only fixable HIGH/CRITICAL
# findings fail a release, so an entry here is a deliberate accepted risk, not
# a way past the gate.
#
# Example (commented out, not an acceptance):
# CVE-2024-00000 exp:2026-12-31 statement:no fix in the pinned base image
